          "url": "https://finance.caixin.com/2026-09-21/102486973.html",
          "published": "Mon, 21 Sep 2026 09:29:53 +0800",
          "summary": "<p>财新网09月21日电:沪指开盘报3920.27点，涨幅0.21%。</p><p>深成指报13716.22点，涨幅0.55%；创业板指报3403.90点，涨幅0.93%；中小板指报8435.58点，涨幅0.39%。</p><p>盘面上，电子领涨，通信、医药生物、传媒、轻工制造、纺织服饰等板块涨幅居前，石油石化领跌，机械设备、房地产、农林牧渔、煤炭、建筑材料等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，中美举行新一轮经贸磋商；国常会听取老龄工作情况汇报，研究推动体育赛事健康发展有关工作；证监会拟奖励17宗案件“吹哨人”，奖金最高100万元；特朗普将组建一支“人工智能部队”并在近期任命AI事务总管；9月LPR报价出炉，5年期和1年期利率均维持不变；<a href=\"https://search.caixin.com/search/%E9%95%BF%E9%91%AB%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80.html\" target=\"_blank\">长鑫科技</a>第五代技术平台量产；工信部副部长<a href=\"https://search.caixin.com/search/%E8%BE%9B%E5%9B%BD%E6%96%8C.html\" target=\"_blank\">辛国斌</a>表示，大力发展开源基座模型和垂类模型。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-09-21</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101003426\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101003426\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">远程股份<p><span class=\"stock-no\">002692.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">8.45</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+8.45</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">远程股份诉湖南省工业设备安装有限公司买卖合同纠纷案2026年9月18日在宜兴市人民法院开庭</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018542\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018542\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">惠泰医疗<p><span class=\"stock-no\">688617.SH</span></p></div><div class=\